cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Real-Vehicle Lateral-Velocity Dataset for 'Vehicle Lateral Velocity Estimation System Embedding Time-Varying Cornering Stiffness Learning Considering Sim-to-Real Gap'"
abstract: >-
  Three 100 Hz real-vehicle recordings from a closed proving ground, used for
  fine-tuning and for the independent evaluation of a physics-guided
  cornering-stiffness learning and Kalman-filtering lateral-velocity estimator.
  Channels include MEMS IMU accelerations and angular rates, four wheel speeds,
  steering-wheel angle, body-frame velocities, and an RTK-GNSS/FOG velocity
  reference.
